Package: orbbecsdk
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, udev
Description: Orbbec SDK v2
 Runtime, C/C++ development files, CMake package files, udev rules and
 command-line tools for Orbbec 3D cameras.
 .
 The firmware update utility is included, but firmware images are not.
 Run it manually after verifying the target model, serial number and
 image checksum.
